# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository.
#
# Eight files under code/lib/ui/editor/mermaid/ arrived with CRLF and nothing
# declared a policy, so any edit made on a machine that writes LF rewrote the
# whole file: an eighteen-line change once showed up as 1371. Git now stores
# text as LF and checks it out however the platform wants it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git never touches the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
